    "semantic_summary": "GeminiAPIModel serves as the primary service layer for interfacing with Google's Gemini models, supporting both direct API key usage and Google Vertex AI integration. It encapsulates complex logic for credential management, converting internal message formats into API-specific structures, and handling synchronous or streamed generation requests. Key functionalities include managing system prompts, processing multimodal inputs via image loading, and providing robust error handling through integrated retry mechanisms."
